/-!
# Stochastic-process infrastructure

Root import for the stochastic-process development: the Markov and semigroup
layer, the divergence-form resolvent and its regularity theory, the
Agmon-type decay estimates, and the supporting functional analysis.

Every module under `Algsuperdiff/StochasticProcess/` is imported here, so a
build of this module compiles the whole tree.
-/
